I've  had this problem, and what I found was that I transferred the
makefile as an ascii file somehow and changed all the tabs into spaces.
Make (on some system) cant deal with 8 spaces but can deal with 1 tab
character. I'd go to where you got the file from and made sure you were
doing a binary transfer OR I'd find an entab program OR I'd go through
by hand and change all of the spaces to tabs.  (not 1-1, but everywerhe
that looks tabed gets a tab.)

